 * The terminal dock hardcoded `lg:left-60` (15rem) while the rail collapses to
 * `lg:w-[4.75rem]`, leaving a ~10rem dead gutter down the left of the terminal
 * whenever a customer collapsed the sidebar. A CSS variable on the document
 * element reaches the dock regardless of where it is mounted.
